# Mysterio's enter trigger resolved after he has left the battlefield: the 2025-09-19 ruling says the ability that removes the tokens
# never triggers. Bot1 has Mysterio's Phantasm (a Villain) out; on turn 3 it casts Mysterio, and with his trigger on the stack Bot2
# kills him with Lightning Bolt. The trigger still counts one nontoken Villain, the Phantasm, and makes one token that stays.

